@TomStDenis2 @LisaSu Thanks!

I've accepted we are going to have to do a lot of root causing if we want the red box experience to be great.

We are working on our /dev/kfd driver here and this should hopefully lead to much clearer issues unmuddled by user space, https://t.co/yDoI55b50x

